<%# The sign-in facts below come from Cedarras's own code (rails-backend:
    EnrollmentMailer, PasswordSetupsController, the /login and /password/new
    routes), read 2026-10-02:
    - A Kit purchase tags the buyer; a Kit webhook makes Cedarras enroll them,
      usually within minutes.
    - A first-time student gets "Welcome — you now have access to <course>"
      from Cedarras <no-reply@cedarras.com>, with a one-time "Set your
      password" link (expires in 7 days; passwords are 12+ characters).
      Setting it does not sign them in; they then sign in at /login.
    - A returning student gets "You now have access to <course>" and just
      signs in.
    - A lost or expired link: /password/new sends a fresh one.
    Re-check these if Cedarras's emails change. %>
<%# Copy: Sales Page Copy.md §3, approved by Lee 2026-10-02. Steps 1 and 2
    agree with the facts above. Two additions, Lee 2026-10-02: step 1 names
    Cedarras as the sender (by name only; no email address on the page), and
    the "new link" line covers a lost or expired set-password link. %>
<% sales = site.data.sales["architecting-for-cost"] %>

<div class="selling-page">
  <header class="selling-page-header">
    <div class="sales-inner">
      <h1>You're in.</h1>
      <p>Thanks for buying Architecting for Cost.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="selling-page-body">
    <div class="sales-inner">
      <ol class="selling-steps">
        <li><strong>Check your email.</strong> Your sign-in details are on the way from Cedarras, the platform the course runs on. Give it a few minutes, and check your spam folder if it doesn't show up.</li>
        <li><strong>Set your password.</strong> If this is your first Atchison Academy course, the email has a link to set one.</li>
        <li><strong>Sign in and start.</strong> Lesson one is about why the finance playbook stops finding money.</li>
      </ol>

      <p><a href="https://courses.atchisonacademy.com/" class="btn btn-deep">Go to your course &rarr;</a></p>

      <p>No email, or the link expired? <a href="https://courses.atchisonacademy.com/password/new">Get a new link</a> using the email you bought with.</p>

      <p>Questions? <%= sales_text "{contact}", sales %></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
